# 5. Argument

One of the major Pāṭala products.

Not merely argument visualization.

A real **Argument Proof**.

```text
premises
inference
conclusion
evidence
defeaters
validity
soundness status
```

Example:

```text
ARG-0182

P1 ...
P2 ...
P3 ...

Therefore C
```

Expose two independent judgements:

```text
VALIDITY
Does C follow from P1–P3?

SOUNDNESS
Are P1–P3 warranted?
```

This matches the reasoning discipline Pāṭala needs.

Checkpoint:

```text
A0 reconstructed
A1 premises grounded
A2 inference classified
A3 validity checked
A4 defeaters generated
A5 rival reconstruction tested
A6 reviewed
```

This can become:

> **Pāṭala Argument**

a standalone product scholars can cite.

