A Review should itself be a publishable object.

```text
Review {
  target
  reviewer
  findings
  severity
  evidence
  proposed corrections
  disposition
}
```

Types:

```text
translation review
argument review
citation review
source review
essay review
benchmark review
```

Statuses:

```text
OPEN
SUPPORTED
REJECTED
RESOLVED
SUPERSEDED
```

This creates a visible scholarly correction history.

