# 9. Research Packet

Extremely practical product.

Instead of telling an agent or scholar to search twenty systems, compile:

```text
ResearchPacket {
  question
  key claims
  primary sources
  strongest secondary literature
  quotations/passages
  disagreement map
  cruxes
  missing evidence
  bibliography
}
```

Example:

> **Research Packet: Does Pratyabhijñā require a permanent self?**

This is useful for:

```text
scholars
students
writers
agents
YouTube research
papers
```

Checkpoint:

```text
RP0 search
RP1 source gathering
RP2 evidence extraction
RP3 contradiction/rival search
RP4 bibliography audit
RP5 reviewed
```

This could be one of the first monetizable scholar products.

